Print preserves sale cost, lot cost, and balance assertions.

========== API ==========

print()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash
account Income:Gain
2024-01-01 Buy
  Assets:Fund  2 FUND {10 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -20 SEK
2024-01-02 Sell
  Assets:Fund  -1 FUND {10 SEK} @@ 12 SEK = 1 FUND
  Assets:Cash  12 SEK
  Income:Gain  -2 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK

commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND

account Assets:Fund

account Assets:Cash

account Income:Gain

2024-01-01 Buy
    Assets:Fund  2 FUND {10 SEK} @ 10 SEK
    Assets:Cash  -20 SEK

2024-01-02 Sell
    Assets:Fund  -1 FUND {10 SEK} @@ 12 SEK = 1 FUND
    Assets:Cash  12 SEK
    Income:Gain  -2 SEK
